      "subtitle": "Native Jellyfin music player for iOS",
      "localizedDescription": "Jellify is a free and open-source music player for Jellyfin, built with React Native. Browse and stream your Jellyfin music libraries on iPhone and iPad with a native interface, fast search, playlists, favorites and now-playing controls — available on the App Store and as sideload builds.",
