      "version": "1.2.10",
      "versionDate": "2026-09-02",
      "versionDescription": "Jellify 1.2.10 | Jellify-1.2.10\n\nWelcome to Jellify 1.2.10\n\nHey music lovers! I've polished up some underlying bits and have made a key fix to boost stability across the board. Get ready for an even smoother listening experience when you’re exploring your Jellyfin collection!\n\n*   **Android Crash Fixes:** We detected and patched out a crash that was occurring on Android devices, so you can now enjoy uninterrupted music playback no matter how deep you dive into your library.\n*   **Optimized Performance:** Several dependency updates have been implemented behind the scenes to enhance overall app performance and make navigation feel snappier than ever before.\n*   **App General Polish:** We've made various quality-of-life improvements in various components, ensuring Jellify remains robust and reliable for years of listening fun!",
      "downloadURL": "https://github.com/Jellify-Music/App/releases/download/1.2.10/Jellify-1.2.10.ipa",
